  {
   "start": 5.32,
   "end": 24.62,
   "text": "Where's Hanszen bro? Like all of Hanszen or like a large part of Hanszen went to Memorial like all of you did. I feel like that can't be good for you right now. No way you skip it."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.26,
   "end": 39.44,
   "text": "Carter, where you at?"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.04,
   "end": 45.92,
   "text": "Oh, okay. Are you sleeping?"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.54,
   "end": 53.32,
   "text": "Tell him to get up. Valid, okay."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.72,
   "end": 60.31,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, that's valid. Thanks, I'll see you."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.95,
   "end": 71.81,
   "text": "He wants to do a shorter ride. What the heck. He wants to do a shorter ride first. He's a long requirer. What's up?"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.49,
   "end": 77.45,
   "text": "This is like below 50. Yo! Finally. What?"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.34,
   "end": 112.46,
   "text": "How does the shifters feel? They feel good."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.46,
   "end": 118.24,
   "text": "I think I want to play within a turn because I like this. This is so crazy."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.32,
   "end": 120.24,
   "text": "Just in time to get dropped."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.48,
   "end": 121.64,
   "text": "It was a really close one."
  },
  {
   "start": 122.66,
   "end": 123.72,
   "text": "Nobody's getting dropped today."
  },
  {
   "start": 123.88,
   "end": 124.7,
   "text": "You'll be with me then."
  },
  {
   "start": 124.98,
   "end": 126.02,
   "text": "No one's getting dropped today."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.76,
   "end": 132.96,
   "text": "I really like it but I've only spent five minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.26,
   "end": 136.08,
   "text": "I needed to go to bed last night."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.02,
   "end": 147.96,
   "text": "Last week I was in the bed looking at the watch, and I was like, what if I just say I'm sorry?"
  },
  {
   "start": 149.5,
   "end": 156.5,
   "text": "You could not, you could stay in bed, but then I was like, no you want to do this. You don't want to do this right now, but you do want to do this ultimately."
  },
  {
   "start": 157.1,
   "end": 161.68,
   "text": "In the middle of the day I'll be like, oh I could have been done with a cool bike ride."
  },
  {
   "start": 161.98,
   "end": 163.6,
   "text": "After your oatmeal you're going to be fine."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.32,
   "end": 166.0,
   "text": "This is true, you're going to wake up."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.32,
   "end": 195.98,
   "text": "I do either oatmeal in the morning or when I forget to rob or when I remember to rob the servery I take a crustable I just get it to go box and I stuff it in. I steal oatmeal from the servery. Hey I have unlimited oatmeal plan. How do you make the oatmeal? I'm exercising. I have a microwave so I just put a bunch of water in it and I basically turn it into water with like oat pieces in it because I don't like when it's like thick. Wait do you put your oatmeal? It's like tea. Do you put your oatmeal?"
  },
  {
   "start": 216.84,
   "end": 217.88,
   "text": "Where's all the brownies"
  },
  {
   "start": 226.4,
   "end": 242.8,
   "text": "That's so tragic. She said she wasn't coming to see if we're going to win. Right. Gabby, Gabby, Gabby."
  },
  {
   "start": 242.8,
   "end": 249.3,
   "text": "Diego, you've complained about this five times in the last 12 hours No bro, yesterday I had today's dumbass's homework to do"
  },
  {
   "start": 249.3,
   "end": 254.58,
   "text": "This guy's class at a TS4 You had a drop, you could have dropped it, you could have dropped it"
  },
  {
   "start": 254.58,
   "end": 259.44,
   "text": "Is uh, is it working? Dude, I hated that one so much"
  },
  {
   "start": 259.44,
   "end": 265.74,
   "text": "He said just Q1, right? Question 1 was evil itself, evil incarnate, that was so-"
  },
  {
   "start": 265.74,
   "end": 269.2,
   "text": "I'm grading question 2, so Dude, I hated it so much"
  },
  {
   "start": 273.94,
   "end": 280.24,
   "text": "When would I ever need to like figure that out in that way all the time?"
  }
